mitted, refresh, and unsupported drivers for all non-missing-rate status labels. Required mappings: Cancelled Payment => CANCELED; Waiting for payment file processing => PAYMENTS_CREATED; Submitted => SUBMITTED; Pending installments selection => UNSTARTED; No available installments => CANCELLED NO PAYMENTS; Pending payments approval => ORA_REQUIRE_APPROVAL; Installments selected => SELECTED; Selecting installments => SELECTING; Failed document validation => VALIDATION_FAILED. Generate paymentProcessRequestStatusCode = <LOOKUP_CODE_FROM_STATUS_NAME> only, plus any explicit user-supplied supported filters. Do not use requestStatusCode, paymentProcessRequestStatus, requestStatus, the display text, or default date filters for this status-name pattern unless the user asks for a date. Missing-rate questions may continue to route to missing-rate review flows.\"        }      ]    },    \"disbursementPaymentInstructions\": {      \"key\": \"disbursementPaymentInstructions\",      \"name\": \"disbursementPaymentInstructions\",      \"type\": \"BV\",      \"shapeRole\": \"detail\",      \"module\": \"oraErpCorePaymentsFundsDisbursement\",      \"businessObject\": \"PayablesPaymentFile\",      \"api\": \"objects/ora/erpCore/paymentsFundsDisbursement/v1/disbursementPaymentInstructions\",      \"description\": \"Business view for payment-file inquiry in Funds Disbursement. Use this shape for file status, creation or transmission failures, pending acknowledgements, payment-file bank context, transmission setup, and payment-file-to-PPR context.\",      \"exampleQuestions\": [        \"Show the transmission configuration and protocol for payment file 12345.\",        \"Which payment files are ready to transmit and what transmission setup will they use?\",        \"Which payment-file transmission configurations are active today?\",        \"Show payment files with transmission failed in the last 30 days.\",        \"Which payment files are pending acknowledgement and for which banks